WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.751 --> 00:00:04.986
&gt;&gt; Announcer: This is CNN

00:00:05.353 --> 00:00:05.486
breaking news.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:06.621
&gt;&gt;&gt; Let's get straight to the

00:00:06.754 --> 00:00:07.455
breaking news.

00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:10.124
Sources now telling CNN that

00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:11.526
Russian naval craft have arrived

00:00:11.659 --> 00:00:13.361
at the site of the U.S. Drone

00:00:13.361 --> 00:00:15.363
downing in the black sea.

00:00:15.363 --> 00:00:16.831
CNN's orrin leiberman is working

00:00:16.964 --> 00:00:19.734
his sources for us over at the

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:20.434
Pentagon.

00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:21.769
Orin, U.S. Officials believe the

00:00:21.903 --> 00:00:22.870
wreckage would be extremely

00:00:23.004 --> 00:00:24.572
difficult to retrieve, but the

00:00:24.705 --> 00:00:26.574
Russians appear to be trying.

00:00:26.707 --> 00:00:29.443
What are you hearing from your

00:00:29.577 --> 00:00:29.810
sources.

00:00:29.944 --> 00:00:30.545
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Two U.S. Officials

00:00:30.678 --> 00:00:33.381
tell us the Russian Navy,

00:00:33.481 --> 00:00:35.383
essentially Russian assets in

00:00:35.383 --> 00:00:35.883
the black sea were able to reach

00:00:36.017 --> 00:00:44.125
the crash site of the m-q9

00:00:44.258 --> 00:00:44.425
drone.

00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:46.394
The Russian Navy has ships based

00:00:46.527 --> 00:00:48.362
in crimea so it wouldn't have

00:00:48.496 --> 00:00:49.597
been that difficult for them to

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:51.399
get their ships to crash site.

00:00:51.399 --> 00:00:52.300
Of course the crucial question

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:54.535
is this is what's unclear is how

00:00:54.669 --> 00:00:55.570
much if anything the Russians

00:00:55.703 --> 00:01:00.007
were able to uncover from the

00:01:00.141 --> 00:01:01.008
m-q9 drone.

00:01:01.409 --> 00:01:02.243
Earlier today with press

00:01:02.376 --> 00:01:04.612
secretary Lloyd Austin and mark

00:01:04.745 --> 00:01:06.480
Milly it was Milly who said

00:01:06.614 --> 00:01:07.715
there probably isn't all that

00:01:07.848 --> 00:01:08.883
much wreckage to recover.

00:01:09.016 --> 00:01:11.419
It was about 4,000 to 5,000 feet

00:01:11.419 --> 00:01:12.720
deep of water there.

00:01:12.853 --> 00:01:14.555
But the Russians according to

00:01:14.689 --> 00:01:15.890
the U.S. Officials were able to

00:01:16.023 --> 00:01:17.758
get to that site.

00:01:17.892 --> 00:01:19.961
Earlier today a senior Russian

00:01:20.094 --> 00:01:21.095
official promised that the

00:01:21.429 --> 00:01:25.733
Russians would try to recover

00:01:25.866 --> 00:01:29.470
what they could from that drone

00:01:29.604 --> 00:01:31.606
and learn what's possible.

00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:32.273
Milly had said the U.S. Had

00:01:32.406 --> 00:01:32.940
taken steps to mitigate the

00:01:33.074 --> 00:01:33.608
collection of any sensitive

00:01:33.741 --> 00:01:33.908
data.

00:01:34.041 --> 00:01:34.642
We reported earlier today that

00:01:34.775 --> 00:01:35.443
before that drone, the U.S.

00:01:35.443 --> 00:01:36.243
Drone that has crashed into the

00:01:36.377 --> 00:01:37.511
black sea, its operators were

00:01:37.645 --> 00:01:39.480
able to wipe the sensitive data,

00:01:39.614 --> 00:01:42.516
the sensitive software

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:43.918
information used in intelligence

00:01:44.051 --> 00:01:45.453
collection from the drone.

00:01:45.586 --> 00:01:46.487
Meaning that though there may be

00:01:46.621 --> 00:01:48.389
some wreckage there, the U.S.

00:01:48.522 --> 00:01:49.490
Believes there isn't sensitive

00:01:49.624 --> 00:01:51.058
top secret data just sitting

00:01:51.459 --> 00:01:52.727
there on top of the black sea.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.463
Meanwhile the Pentagon promising

00:01:55.463 --> 00:01:57.465
it'll keep operating over

00:01:57.465 --> 00:01:58.666
international waters and giving

00:01:58.799 --> 00:02:00.368
the sense of how they view the

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:01.469
Russian actions here.

00:02:01.469 --> 00:02:04.372
&gt;&gt; I'll just reiterate that the

00:02:04.505 --> 00:02:07.975
United States will fly and

00:02:08.109 --> 00:02:09.810
operate wherever international

00:02:09.944 --> 00:02:11.846
law allows.

00:02:11.979 --> 00:02:14.215
Now, we take any potential for

00:02:14.348 --> 00:02:16.717
escalation very seriously, and

00:02:16.851 --> 00:02:17.985
that's why I believe it's

00:02:18.119 --> 00:02:20.554
important to keep the lines of

00:02:20.688 --> 00:02:21.088
communication open.

00:02:21.489 --> 00:02:23.491
&gt;&gt; So was it intentional or not?

00:02:23.524 --> 00:02:24.125
Don't know yet.

00:02:24.258 --> 00:02:25.793
We know that the intercept was

00:02:25.926 --> 00:02:26.193
intentional.

00:02:26.327 --> 00:02:27.928
We know the aggressive behavior

00:02:28.062 --> 00:02:28.396
was intentional.

00:02:28.529 --> 00:02:29.830
We also know it was very

00:02:29.964 --> 00:02:31.499
unprofessional and very unsafe.

00:02:31.499 --> 00:02:33.501
The actual contact of the fixed

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:37.605
wing Russian fighter with our

00:02:37.738 --> 00:02:38.439
uav, the physical contact of

00:02:38.572 --> 00:02:39.840
those two, not sure yet.

00:02:39.974 --> 00:02:41.676
That remain Tuesday be seen, but

00:02:41.809 --> 00:02:43.511
I can't -- I can tell you with

00:02:43.644 --> 00:02:45.513
certainty, though, we have

00:02:45.579 --> 00:02:46.947
absolute evidence of the contact

00:02:47.081 --> 00:02:49.116
and the intercepts, et cetera.

00:02:49.517 --> 00:02:50.718
And it's very aggressive.

00:02:50.851 --> 00:02:53.154
You've heard about the dumping

00:02:53.521 --> 00:02:53.888
of the fuel and everything else.

00:02:54.021 --> 00:02:54.855
We have video evidence of all

00:02:54.989 --> 00:02:55.156
that.

00:02:55.523 --> 00:02:56.257
We know where it landed in the

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:56.957
black sea.

00:02:57.091 --> 00:02:59.560
Probably about 4, 5,000 feet of

00:02:59.694 --> 00:03:00.327
water.

00:03:00.461 --> 00:03:02.396
Recovery efforts are very

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:03.531
difficult at that depth by

00:03:03.531 --> 00:03:03.664
anyone.

00:03:03.798 --> 00:03:06.267
It probably broke up and

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.535
probably not a lot to recover,

00:03:07.535 --> 00:03:07.635
frankly.

00:03:07.768 --> 00:03:09.537
As far as the loss of anything

00:03:09.603 --> 00:03:10.638
sensitive intelligence, et

00:03:10.771 --> 00:03:12.039
cetera, as normal we would

00:03:12.173 --> 00:03:15.543
take -- and we did take

00:03:15.543 --> 00:03:15.876
mitigating measures.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.144
So we are quite confident that

00:03:17.545 --> 00:03:18.646
whatever was of value is no

00:03:18.779 --> 00:03:19.547
longer of value.

00:03:19.547 --> 00:03:21.549
&gt;&gt; In the day and a half or so

00:03:21.549 --> 00:03:22.583
since this happened there's been

00:03:22.717 --> 00:03:23.784
a number of communications both

00:03:23.918 --> 00:03:26.921
in the diplomatic channel and

00:03:27.054 --> 00:03:27.588
now in the military channel

00:03:27.722 --> 00:03:27.888
here.

00:03:28.022 --> 00:03:29.557
And what it seems there's

00:03:29.557 --> 00:03:30.891
agreement upon there's no desire

00:03:31.025 --> 00:03:32.660
from the U.S. Or Russia for

00:03:32.793 --> 00:03:33.994
escalation around this specific

00:03:34.128 --> 00:03:34.361
incident.

00:03:34.495 --> 00:03:35.563
However, the cause of the

00:03:35.563 --> 00:03:37.832
incident that's where we have

00:03:37.965 --> 00:03:38.566
entire disagreements.

00:03:38.699 --> 00:03:41.001
The U.S. Making their case clear

00:03:41.135 --> 00:03:42.470
there from both Milly and Austin

00:03:42.603 --> 00:03:44.071
that it was the Russian fighter

00:03:44.205 --> 00:03:45.573
jets who were acting in a

00:03:45.639 --> 00:03:46.707
reckless fashion there.

00:03:46.841 --> 00:03:48.209
Meanwhile, in a call between

00:03:48.342 --> 00:03:50.544
Austin and his counterpart, the

00:03:50.678 --> 00:03:53.581
Russian defense minister, the

00:03:53.581 --> 00:03:54.448
minister essentially tried to

00:03:54.582 --> 00:03:56.083
lecture Austin about the U.S.

00:03:56.217 --> 00:03:58.719
Actions here saying the U.S.

00:03:58.853 --> 00:03:59.653
Flew the drone in a provocative

00:03:59.787 --> 00:04:02.123
fashion, flying around crimea is

00:04:02.256 --> 00:04:03.991
itself provocative and Russia

00:04:04.125 --> 00:04:05.159
had essentially declared there

00:04:05.593 --> 00:04:07.962
was some sort of airspace around

00:04:08.095 --> 00:04:10.097
its, quote, special military

00:04:10.231 --> 00:04:11.899
operation the U.S. Should have

00:04:12.032 --> 00:04:12.233
avoided.

00:04:12.366 --> 00:04:13.601
Wolf, there's still certainly

00:04:13.667 --> 00:04:14.735
disagreement on the cause of

00:04:14.869 --> 00:04:16.003
this, but at least it seems

00:04:16.137 --> 00:04:17.238
there's no desire to escalate

00:04:17.605 --> 00:04:18.038
from this point.

00:04:18.172 --> 00:04:20.741
&gt;&gt; We shall see.

00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:21.876
Orenleiberman at the Pentagon,

00:04:22.009 --> 00:04:22.910
thank you very much.

00:04:23.043 --> 00:04:24.979
Joining us now top white house

00:04:25.112 --> 00:04:26.781
national security official John

00:04:26.914 --> 00:04:27.081
Kirby.

00:04:27.214 --> 00:04:28.349
John, thanks for joining us.

00:04:28.482 --> 00:04:30.050
I want to begin with our new

00:04:30.184 --> 00:04:31.252
reporting that the Russians have

00:04:31.619 --> 00:04:33.621
now reached the site of the

00:04:33.621 --> 00:04:34.188
drone crash.

00:04:34.321 --> 00:04:35.756
Is there any cause for concern

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.191
it Russia eventually recovers

00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:38.692
this debris from the drone?

00:04:38.826 --> 00:04:40.528
&gt;&gt; Well, I certainly can't

00:04:40.661 --> 00:04:41.629
confirm the reports they're on

00:04:41.629 --> 00:04:41.862
the site.

00:04:41.996 --> 00:04:44.832
I'm aware of their comments of

00:04:44.965 --> 00:04:45.633
trying to get there and trying

00:04:45.699 --> 00:04:45.966
to recover.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.301
But the short answer to your

00:04:47.635 --> 00:04:48.602
question is no.

00:04:48.736 --> 00:04:50.304
As general Milly made clear, we

00:04:50.437 --> 00:04:51.772
made it impossible for them to

00:04:51.906 --> 00:04:54.108
be able to glean anything of

00:04:54.241 --> 00:04:55.075
intelligence value off the

00:04:55.209 --> 00:04:57.044
remnants of that drone, whatever

00:04:57.178 --> 00:04:58.112
remnants there might be on the

00:04:58.245 --> 00:04:59.113
surface of the water.

00:04:59.246 --> 00:05:01.649
&gt;&gt; Because as you just point out

00:05:01.749 --> 00:05:03.083
other U.S. Officials have said

00:05:03.217 --> 00:05:04.819
they've managed to actually

00:05:04.952 --> 00:05:06.287
erase sensitive software on the

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.655
drone remotely before it

00:05:07.788 --> 00:05:09.657
actually crashed into the black

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:09.824
sea.

00:05:09.957 --> 00:05:12.026
Does this debris have any value

00:05:12.159 --> 00:05:14.829
for Russia, though, even if just

00:05:14.962 --> 00:05:16.797
for propaganda?

00:05:16.931 --> 00:05:17.832
&gt;&gt; It's really going to be

00:05:17.965 --> 00:05:20.267
difficult to say, wolf.

00:05:20.401 --> 00:05:20.868
I would tend towards no.

00:05:21.001 --> 00:05:23.337
Whatever is left of that that's

00:05:23.671 --> 00:05:25.673
floating will probably be flight

00:05:25.806 --> 00:05:28.409
control surfaces, that kind of

00:05:28.542 --> 00:05:29.977
thing, probably nothing of real

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:31.679
intrinsic value to them in terms

00:05:31.679 --> 00:05:33.080
of re-engineering or anything

00:05:33.214 --> 00:05:33.714
like that.

00:05:33.848 --> 00:05:36.250
We're not overly concerned about

00:05:36.383 --> 00:05:37.685
whatever they might get their

00:05:37.785 --> 00:05:38.452
hands on.

00:05:38.586 --> 00:05:39.687
That said and secretary Austin

00:05:39.787 --> 00:05:42.423
said this today, it's our

00:05:42.556 --> 00:05:47.695
property, and they have no

00:05:47.795 --> 00:05:48.963
business recovering anything.

00:05:49.096 --> 00:05:49.697
&gt;&gt; As you know the U.S. Does not

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:50.397
currently have any ships the

00:05:50.531 --> 00:05:51.265
black sea.

00:05:51.699 --> 00:05:52.700
Is the Biden administration

00:05:52.833 --> 00:05:54.368
considering taking any steps to

00:05:54.501 --> 00:05:56.437
keep this downed drone out of

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:57.137
Russia's hands?

00:05:57.271 --> 00:05:58.472
&gt;&gt; I think the Pentagon is still

00:05:58.606 --> 00:06:00.107
taking a look at whatever

00:06:00.241 --> 00:06:01.108
recovery options might be

00:06:01.242 --> 00:06:02.409
available to them.

00:06:02.543 --> 00:06:03.711
I think you can imagine that

00:06:03.811 --> 00:06:05.179
they're fairly limited given we

00:06:05.312 --> 00:06:16.357
don't have a naval presence in

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:17.191
the black.

00:06:17.324 --> 00:06:20.060
I don't want to get ahead of the

00:06:20.194 --> 00:06:20.794
defense department and what they

00:06:20.928 --> 00:06:28.202
might be thinking.

00:06:28.335 --> 00:06:29.737
&gt;&gt; There are other navies that

00:06:29.737 --> 00:06:31.171
we partner with and have

00:06:31.305 --> 00:06:35.009
terrific relationships with in

00:06:35.142 --> 00:06:37.778
the black sea and I would refer

00:06:37.912 --> 00:06:38.946
to the defense department I

00:06:39.079 --> 00:06:41.248
don't know plans to use ally

00:06:41.382 --> 00:06:42.783
naval assets to attempt

00:06:42.917 --> 00:06:43.350
recovery.

00:06:43.751 --> 00:06:51.926
I want to stress, wolf.

00:06:52.059 --> 00:06:53.294
Again, it's our property and we

00:06:53.427 --> 00:06:54.161
certainly don't want the

00:06:54.295 --> 00:06:56.397
Russians getting it, but we're

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:57.998
not overly concerned about

00:06:58.132 --> 00:07:01.402
anything they might glean off of

00:07:01.769 --> 00:07:01.835
it.

00:07:01.835 --> 00:07:03.203
Russia is publicly accusing the

00:07:03.337 --> 00:07:04.939
United States of what it calls

00:07:05.072 --> 00:07:07.775
violations of what it calls its

00:07:07.775 --> 00:07:09.977
flight restriction zone in that

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.345
black sea area.

00:07:11.779 --> 00:07:12.579
Should we expect to see Russia

00:07:12.713 --> 00:07:14.982
continue to escalate as it tries

00:07:15.115 --> 00:07:16.817
to establish new rules in the

00:07:16.951 --> 00:07:17.117
skies?

00:07:17.251 --> 00:07:18.018
&gt;&gt; We don't want to see

00:07:18.152 --> 00:07:19.787
escalation here and there's no

00:07:19.787 --> 00:07:21.822
need for that.

00:07:21.956 --> 00:07:24.525
This m-q9 was flying in

00:07:24.658 --> 00:07:25.793
international airspace and we're

00:07:25.793 --> 00:07:26.894
going to continue to fly and

00:07:27.027 --> 00:07:28.195
operate where international law

00:07:28.329 --> 00:07:28.829
permits us to.

00:07:28.963 --> 00:07:31.332
That's what we did in this case.

00:07:31.465 --> 00:07:32.433
That's what we'll continue to

00:07:32.566 --> 00:07:32.700
do.

00:07:32.833 --> 00:07:38.172
We have real national security

00:07:38.305 --> 00:07:39.440
interests and all that effort is

00:07:39.807 --> 00:07:40.207
going to continue.

00:07:40.341 --> 00:07:45.813
&gt;&gt; Secretary Austin and general

00:07:45.846 --> 00:07:46.780
Milly both spoke with their

00:07:46.914 --> 00:07:48.382
Russian counter parts today and

00:07:48.515 --> 00:07:48.949
that was significant.

00:07:49.083 --> 00:07:50.117
Has the Biden administration

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:51.819
received any assurances at all

00:07:51.819 --> 00:07:53.387
from Russia it'll stop engaging

00:07:53.821 --> 00:07:55.155
in these kind of aggressive acts

00:07:55.289 --> 00:07:55.956
against the United States like

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.892
the downing of this drone, for

00:07:59.026 --> 00:07:59.226
example?

00:07:59.360 --> 00:07:59.860
&gt;&gt; We made it very clear.

00:07:59.994 --> 00:08:01.829
I know the defense department

00:08:01.829 --> 00:08:09.837
did in their calls, and we made

00:08:09.837 --> 00:08:11.138
it clear this is unacceptable

00:08:11.271 --> 00:08:15.843
and don't want to see any repeat

00:08:15.843 --> 00:08:20.647
occurrences of this.

00:08:20.781 --> 00:08:23.150
We have laid bare our concerns

